  m_text: "LEFT-CLICK : Basic Attack\nPress E over your defeated enemies to resurrect
    them at your side, disect them to get materials or use thoose materials to summon
    a powerful ally \nV Button : Use the potions you have collected.\n\nYou can give
    instructions to your minions : \n- TAB : To focus a close enemy\n- R Button :
    The minions will return to you.\n- F Button : The minions will attack a single
    target.\nPress T Button to enter the tactical mode and select instructions for
    each minion.\n\nItems to PickUp\n- Red Light : Potions\n- White Light : Necromancy
    Materials\n- Green Light : Green Gate Keys"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a3eac893e7775d74b9a2c961712ec925, type: 2}
